{"id":"memorial_201201","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial201200","label":"UNBREAKABLE SPHERE · Her Forgotten Story"},"label":"Entry 1","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_201202","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_201201_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"I'm not sure how long it's been since I finished making this bubble garden inside Gluttony. A month, maybe?"},{"id":"memorial_201201_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"(I sometimes forget to keep track of the days, so it's not exact.)"},{"id":"memorial_201201_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"What can I do now..."},{"id":"memorial_201201_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"How can I let them know that I'm still here?"},{"id":"memorial_201201_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"What if Cinderella or Abe is in danger?"},{"id":"memorial_201201_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"What if the mission to climb the Lift failed? What if that thing is still out there in space, forever a looming threat?"},{"id":"memorial_201201_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"Is there any way to help them?"},{"id":"memorial_201201_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"Is there really nothing I can do?"},{"id":"memorial_201201_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_unbreakablesphere_01_01_description","text":"Lately, that's all I've been thinking about."}]}